---
title: "accrueInterest (Compound Whitepaper)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_block: accrueInterest() called
    q_check_block --> q_noop: currentBlock = accrualBlockNumber (no blocks elapsed)
    q_check_block --> q_calc_blocks: currentBlock > accrualBlockNumber
    q_noop --> [*]: return (no update needed)
    q_calc_blocks --> q_calc_utilization: blockDelta = currentBlock - accrualBlockNumber
    q_calc_utilization --> q_calc_rate: utilizationRate = totalBorrows / (cash + totalBorrows)
    q_calc_rate --> q_calc_borrow_rate: borrowRate = interestRateModel.getBorrowRate(utilizationRate)
    q_calc_borrow_rate --> q_calc_interest: interestAccumulated = borrowRate * blockDelta * totalBorrows
    q_calc_interest --> q_update_index: borrowIndex = borrowIndex * (1 + borrowRate * blockDelta)
    q_update_index --> q_update_borrows: totalBorrows = totalBorrows + interestAccumulated
    q_update_borrows --> q_update_reserves: reserves = reserves + interestAccumulated * reserveFactor
    q_update_reserves --> [*]: accrualBlockNumber = currentBlock

    note right of q_calc_utilization
        INV-001: utilizationRate = totalBorrows / (cash + totalBorrows), range [0, 1]
        INV-002: when totalBorrows = 0, utilizationRate = 0
    end note

    note right of q_update_index
        INV-003: borrowIndex is monotonically increasing
        INV-004: borrowIndex(n) = borrowIndex(n-1) * (1 + r * t)
    end note

    note right of q_update_reserves
        INV-005: reserves increase proportionally to reserveFactor * interestAccumulated
        INV-006: totalBorrows(n) = totalBorrows(n-1) * (1 + r * t)
        INV-007: accrualBlockNumber must be updated to current block
    end note
